{"id":"f804bc8a063d6592","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family.md","title":"ZFC Prob4 Independent Event Family","display":"df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family — ZFC Prob4 Independent Event Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family"],"display":"df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family — ZFC Prob4 Independent Event Family","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob4-independent-event-family — ZFC Prob4 Independent Event Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,I,\\vec A\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,I,\\vec A\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\Omega)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}independent\\text{-}event\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,I,\\vec A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,I,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall J\\in[I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\n\\mathbb P\\left(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega\\mid\\forall i\\in J\\;(\\omega\\in\\vec A(i))\\}\\right)\n=\\prod_{i\\in J}\\mathbb P(\\vec A(i))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}independent\\text{-}event\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4IndependentEventFamily}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,I,\\vec A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,I,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall J\\in[I]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\n\\mathbb P\\left(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega\\mid\\forall i\\in J\\;(\\omega\\in\\vec A(i))\\}\\right)\n=\\prod_{i\\in J}\\mathbb P(\\vec A(i))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The event on the left is relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>; for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\varnothing\">\\(J=\\varnothing\\)</span> it is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>, matching the empty product <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor